== Effects ==
* Gives Isaac +5 {{e|Bomb}}s.
* {{dlc|nr}} Isaac's bombs split into 2-4 tiny bombs after exploding.
* {{dlc|r}} Isaac's bombs split into 4-5 tiny bombs after exploding.
* Tiny bombs deal half damage and have decreased blast radius.
** Tiny bombs retain most of Isaac's bomb synergies.
** {{Dlc|r}} Tiny bombs explode immediately upon landing.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}}/{{i|Curse of the Tower}}/{{p|XVI - The Tower}}: Not recommended. The extra bombs makes it very hard to avoid taking damage.
* {{dlc|r}} {{i|Anarchist Cookbook}}: No visual change can be seen with the Troll Bombs, but the smaller bombs have the sprite of the smaller normal bombs.
* {{i|Best Friend}}: The explosion creates mini decoys.
* {{t|Blasting Cap}}: Tiny bombs can also drop bomb pickups.
* {{dlc+|r}} {{i|Blood Bombs}}/{{I|Bob's Curse}}: Area-of-Effects from extra explosions have decreased size but deal the same damage.{{dlc-}}
* {{i|Bob's Rotten Head}}/{{i|Doctor's Remote}}/{{I|Epic Fetus}}: Explosions are unaffected.
* {{t|Bob's Bladder}}: Tiny bombs will also create creep.
* {{i|Brimstone Bombs}}/{{I|Sad Bombs}}: Lasers/tears from extra explosions deal 65% of their normal damage.
* {{dlc|r}} {{i|Butt Bombs}}: The room damage from extra explosions deal 6.5 damage instead of 10.
* {{i|Diplopia}}: No effect other than the +5 bombs.
* {{i|Dr. Fetus}}/{{i|Mr. Boom}}: Explosions are affected.
* {{i|Ghost Bombs}}: Extra explosions create ghosts that instantly launch themselves at enemies and explode, similar to {{i|Purgatory}}. They each deal 2x Isaac's damage, up to 4 times.
* {{i|Glitter Bombs}}: Each additional explosion created has a chance to spawn a pickup or trinket.
* {{i|Hot Bombs}}: Extra explosions create additional fires. {{dlc|r}} Fires from extra explosions start with 1 less durability.
* {{i|Nancy Bombs}}: Extra bombs will have the same bomb modifiers as the original.
* {{i|Rocket in a Jar}}: Rockets create normal tiny bombs when they explode.

